## Integration Test Threading

`make test` owns one pinned Lemonade runtime across all test binaries. The
hardware-backed suite is serial because concurrent modules otherwise contend
for the same GPU/NPU server resources.

```bash
make test
cargo test --workspace -- --test-threads=1 # narrow direct iteration
```

